 fashion requiring copyright permission, other than the making of an
 exact copy.

 "Propagate" means any activity that, without permission, makes the
 work available to third parties, excluding executing a copy.

 "Convey" means any kind of propagation that enables other parties to
 make or receive copies of the work.

 "Appropriate Legal Notices" means notices that refer to the work and
